    "body": "Hi @arthurlogilab \r\n\r\nThanks for the kind words :)\r\n\r\nI skimmed the tutorial you posted, but I didn't see an answer to my main question, which will probably determine if we can easily support this or not: is there a simple, on-disk format that describes what active topic is? (e.g. a file at `.hg/topic`, or a line in a config file somewhere).\r\n\r\nOur VCS modules are implemented by reading the actual VCS files and parsing them, so we'd need some way to easily tell which topic is active by looking at files.",
